    "notes": {
        "d687cb7a-3194-4213-ba83-55e39085db7f": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Self-provoking trigger flow\n\nThe bottom lane creates a draft order with `draftOrderCreate` (Make API Call, GraphQL) one minute after the start — the **Wait** gives the webhook subscription registered on flow start time to become active; do not remove it.\n\nThe trigger lane asserts the emitted draft order and deletes it after `AfterAll` (`draftOrderDelete`). The app needs `read_draft_orders` and `write_draft_orders`."
        }
    },
